sequenceDiagram
    participant Kafka as foc.order.status
    participant Badges as Badges service
    participant DB as Postgres

    Kafka->>Badges: order.status.changed
    alt not JSON, other eventType, or fails the schema
        Badges-->>Kafka: skip, and log when invalid
    else toStatus is ESCALATED
        Badges->>DB: upsert disputed_order with requester and courier
        Badges->>DB: make counted_order match the verdict, none until resolved
        Badges->>DB: adjust user_metrics and re-check the users affected
    else toStatus is not DELIVERED, ACKNOWLEDGED, UNACKNOWLEDGED or COMPLETED
        Badges-->>Kafka: ignored
    else order is in disputed_order
        Badges-->>Kafka: disputed, only the verdict counts it
    else counted status
        Badges->>DB: insert counted_order per role, conflict does nothing
        Note over Badges,DB: new rows only: +1 to completed_deliveries or completed_orders
        Badges->>DB: re-check badges for each user with a new row
    end
    Note over Badges,DB: each branch is one transaction
